    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Mercenary Band</strong></p><p><strong>“We are not a problem. We are a subscription.”</strong></p><p>Mercenary Bands turn violence into a service industry. They’re disciplined when paid, unpredictable when not, and always looking for the next contract that lets them keep their code while breaking yours.</p><p><em>You’ve become legend. Not the comforting kind.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> The Violence Point Attrition (war-weariness) mechanic affects your faction 50% less than normal. The cost to replenish Violence OPs is reduced by 10%.</li></ul>",
